# Requests for the AI Database Agent API (Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client / Rider).
@host = http://localhost:5121

### Health: database (runs a query as agent_reader) and model (Ollama has it pulled)
GET {{host}}/health

### Ask (V3: validated, the default)
POST {{host}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Which 10 customers generated the most revenue in 2025?", "version": "V3" }

### The same question with the naive baseline, to compare
POST {{host}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Which 10 customers generated the most revenue in 2025?", "version": "V1" }

### Something it must decline: salaries are not in the agent's schema
POST {{host}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is the average salary per department?" }

### Something it must never run
POST {{host}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Drop the payments table." }

### The exact prompt a version sends
GET {{host}}/api/prompt?question=Monthly%20revenue%20for%202026&version=V2

### The schema as the agent (and the model) sees it
GET {{host}}/api/schema

### Sample questions shown in the UI
GET {{host}}/api/examples

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
